;;; mf-pv.scm -- the positive variation nu+ (57) of a signed measure: value, bounds, monotonicity.
;;; Agent M-F, 2026-10-29.  DESTINATION: theorem-library/signed-measure-laws.scm (after mf-fa).  Library: measure.
;;; Helper prefix: mfp-.  Load window: after mf-fa.scm, extended-reals-pos laws (esup-*).

